{"id":"te_moignage","lemma":"témoignage","pos":"noun","rank":2156,"glosses":["testimony"],"ipa":"/te.mwa.ɲaʒ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d5/Fr-t%C3%A9moignage.ogg/Fr-t%C3%A9moignage.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"témoignages"},"formAudio":{"témoignages":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-t%C3%A9moignages.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous aimerions vous remettre ceci en témoignage de notre reconnaissance.","en":"We'd like to give this to you as a token of our appreciation.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to put back, replace"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"our"},{"g":"recognition"}]},{"text":"Nous savons désormais que le témoignage qu'il donna était contraint.","en":"We now know that the testimony he gave was coerced.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"soap","l":"savon"},{"g":"henceforth"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"constrained"}]},{"text":"Nous savons à présent que le témoignage qu'il a fourni a été obtenu sous la contrainte.","en":"We now know that the testimony he gave was coerced.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"soap","l":"savon"},null,null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"abundant, luxuriant"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"to get, to obtain","l":"obtenir"},{"g":"below, under"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"constraint"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"now"]]}]}